WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.800
En 1940,

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.500
Disney estrenó

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.420
Pinocho en

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.200
plena Segunda

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:04.420
Guerra

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:05.020
Mundial.

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:05.680
Las familias

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:06.260
tenían menos

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:07.320
dinero y la

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:08.200
guerra frenó su

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:08.720
distribución

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:09.240
internacional.

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:10.680
Costó 2,6

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.180
millones de

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:11.840
dólares, pero

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:12.600
recaudó solo

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.020
1,4 en su

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:14.480
estreno.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.280
Después,

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.120
Pinocho y otros

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:16.760
personajes de

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:17.080
Disney

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.160
participaron en

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:18.660
propaganda

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:19.640
militar.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.180
Eso impulsó su

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:21.960
recuperación.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.320
Para 1945,

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:24.960
acumulaba

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:25.860
84

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:27.180
millones de

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:27.980
dólares en

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:28.800
beneficios.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:29.380
¿La mejor

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:29.920
campaña de

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:30.720
marketing?

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:31.840
Suscríbete.
